msgstr "启用 SQM 公平与分级调度"

msgid "Realtime / Gaming / VoIP Floor (%)"
msgstr "实时 / 游戏 / 语音最低保障比例（%）"

msgid "Minimum guaranteed bandwidth on Q16/Q48 (weight 15) for DNS, NTP, SSH, STUN/WebRTC, ZeroTier, WireGuard, small UDP game packets, and EF/CS5-7 DSCP."
msgstr "分配给高优硬件队列 Q16/Q48（权重 15）的最低保障带宽，覆盖 DNS/NTP/SSH/STUN/ZeroTier/WireGuard/游戏小包及 EF/CS5-7。"

msgid "Video / QUIC Streaming Ceiling (%)"
msgstr "流媒体 / QUIC 视频比例上限（%）"

msgid "Maximum share on Q30/Q62 (weight 6) for QUIC UDP/443 media and recognized streaming TLS SNI."
msgstr "分配给视频流硬件队列 Q30/Q62（权重 6）的最高可用比例，识别 QUIC 及主流视频 TLS SNI。"

msgid "P2P / BitTorrent Scavenger Ceiling (%)"
msgstr "P2P / BT 低优清道夫上限（%）"

msgid "Strict ceiling on Q31/Q63 (weight 1) for BitTorrent/DHT/eDonkey and CS1/LE bulk traffic."
msgstr "严格限制在清道夫队列 Q31/Q63（权重 1），识别 BT/DHT/电驴及 CS1/LE 流量，防止抢占网页与游戏。"

msgid "Prioritize Pure TCP Control / ACK Packets"
msgstr "优先调度纯 TCP ACK/握手控制包"

msgid "Fallback CAKE DiffServ (only when HNAT=0)"
msgstr "CAKE 差分服务模式（仅 HNAT=0 回退生效）"

msgid "Fallback CAKE ACK Filter (only when HNAT=0)"
msgstr "CAKE ACK 过滤（仅 HNAT=0 回退生效）"

msgid "Enable Simultaneous Per-Host EQoS & Connection Limits"
msgstr "同时启用单主机硬件 EQoS 限速与连接数限制"

msgid "Per-Host Hardware EQoS Rules (Up to 15 Concurrent Hosts: UL Q1-15 / DL Q33-47)"
msgstr "单主机硬件 EQoS 规则表（最多支持 15 台并发主机：上行 Q1-15 / 下行 Q33-47）"

